            "context": {
              "ar": "إِنَّ اللَّهَ اشْتَرَىٰ مِنَ الْمُؤْمِنِينَ أَنفُسَهُمْ وَأَمْوَالَهُم بِأَنَّ لَهُمُ الْجَنَّةَ",
              "en": "God has purchased from the believers their lives and their wealth in exchange for Paradise - parallels the concept of divine reward for devotion and sacrifice in visiting the shrines of the Imams."
